# Usage stats

Settings section `usage-stats` is the desktop restyle of `dsh-usage-panel`. Tokens / `ui-primitives` only; no billing, CNY, or `/user/balance`. UTC day buckets in v1. Desktop `desktop-plugins` copy wins over a marketplace install of the same package. Empty state is no billed usage (blank-only sessions included) with no scan failures; light heatmap empty cells must stay visible. Mounting rides the desktop overlay `desktop-usage-panel.patch.yml` (`--patch`, full starts only) — never a managed block in the user-owned `cordis.patch.yml`; the overlay is deleted when disabled, ensure fails, or a marketplace bundle already mounts the package.

